{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>已故賭王何鴻燊三房千金何超蓮，一向有「最美千金」的美譽，她在2023年4月與內地男星竇驍結婚之後，積極發展個人事業，成為時尚圈的寵兒。日前何超蓮在社交平台分享拍攝花絮，片中所見，身穿黑色西裝的何超蓮，一改以往優雅乖巧的千金形象，激罕以男仔頭短髮示人，她對着鏡頭大擺Pose，疑似真空上陣的她相當性感，期間不時俯身，令胸前春光乍洩，大騷好身材！</p><figure><img alt=\"何超蓮婚後更添女人味。（微博@何超蓮Laurinda）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250925/1047932529069264896156209.jpeg/IxtsYU-V7bmoM7j4N9cXzx0OHKqLgOudN-dURzfnVEc\"/><figcaption>何超蓮婚後更添女人味。（微博@何超蓮Laurinda）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何超蓮在社交平台分享拍攝花絮。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176892690076667904172034.jpeg/aAz20-mpLiAMS-voaAsw_3Gcpuh9BrTqnLEP4JyxD-A\"/><figcaption>何超蓮在社交平台分享拍攝花絮。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何超蓮在社交平台分享拍攝花絮。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176892687748698112312960.jpeg/ZEv7IXeDX0u3uKN3tLFtUsH5wAMq_sMklsmz_pbJs_4\"/><figcaption>何超蓮在社交平台分享拍攝花絮。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"疑似真空上陣。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176892685714329600391728.jpeg/UOnQamg5f8WuLG01b-pCdqQHD4exJefJ0Ut2UNFLdlA\"/><figcaption>疑似真空上陣。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"疑似真空上陣。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176892683533160448563417.jpeg/36NYybiR2g68_Vb3IN8Ri6_DMcqCZQb4OXtHKTl7Ryk\"/><figcaption>疑似真空上陣。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"相當性感。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176892686486474752250679.jpeg/DWrCUjNtI_Us3spzAxexp1T7MsppV0K51FhOFtRYThY\"/><figcaption>相當性感。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大騷好身材。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176892684288528384728459.jpeg/WoEJtwCVAXe67wnzd4aaw1FG5-hnWfGC0935f9Pd-X8\"/><figcaption>大騷好身材。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大騷好身材。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176892682333851648172085.jpeg/jCgVvtiAVBZ4nsv8GPF-DYkU2wd5TKRv2oflQdqH5UE\"/><figcaption>大騷好身材。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"暗黑版。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176892680186236928103489.jpeg/kJd4qoTqu18PA_hQYBz0hupQ7sKBwftgNCBN5jQgTeY\"/><figcaption>暗黑版。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"變返女仔look。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176892678009262080026315.jpeg/BjENQw6ur60eprxlY4oxgw6ZDLytfWV3fty6UH7culA\"/><figcaption>變返女仔look。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>何超蓮婚後更添女人味　不忘大派福利騷身材</p><p>其實何超蓮一向對身材管理極為嚴格，即使已為人妻，但過往亦不時在社交平台大派福利，盡顯玲瓏身材！雖然何超蓮與竇驍自2023年結婚後聚少離多，多次傳出婚變傳聞，但何超蓮曾公開表示，雖然兩人少見面，但每天都會視訊或電話聯絡，感情穩定。去年12月竇驍37歲生日，何超蓮就身穿青蛙裝現身，為老公竇驍送上驚喜，兩人甜蜜相擁吹蠟燭，何超蓮又深情望着老公，相當Sweet，力證明夫妻感情不受婚變傳聞影響！</p><figure><img alt=\"何超蓮大曬泳衣照。（IG@laurinda_ho）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1158044828463009792512830.jpeg/PVBysN7h_wBYcV_VfzvgXWoQ7at7qqczSr8kXEq_JFw\"/><figcaption>何超蓮大曬泳衣照。（IG@laurinda_ho）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"顏值爆燈。（小紅書@何超蓮）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1158050309247864832187294.jpeg/V13RzcCXqvTGIPQbvqelKihqp7pLo1hH6sfskurH7JI\"/><figcaption>顏值爆燈。（小紅書@何超蓮）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"另一套雖然剪裁保守，但緊身設計盡顯何超蓮玲瓏有致的身材。（IG@laurinda_ho）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1158049124411641856438672.jpeg/I-_s_khpZABAGqwrnhi0lq_jPg5sJG2Ox-9O2sfvTto\"/><figcaption>另一套雖然剪裁保守，但緊身設計盡顯何超蓮玲瓏有致的身材。（IG@laurinda_ho）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2023年結婚。（微博@竇驍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251022/1057665464961863680301827.jpeg/JLOkP4qnX4XPGR7IZw0cRYb_VIQqq5LFB5e2YAeXtmA\"/><figcaption>2023年結婚。（微博@竇驍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何超蓮同竇驍。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250510/997912733607530496172648.jpeg/NciIOACzL3Qfl7VkQ7caVkxD1xhaoHeXC5yuQAucrkA\"/><figcaption>何超蓮同竇驍。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"驚喜慶生！（小紅書圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251216/1077605551988805632721059.jpeg/bTvrWqCtx2YL0H9LNmqrtldCZcfNISB3uS2hfbktoX0\"/><figcaption>驚喜慶生！（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吹蠟燭！（小紅書圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251216/1077605549883133952753649.jpeg/vdqMoFioTyNHPC_cd1JatktHWjUcB47Mj_7zi4_-84s\"/><figcaption>吹蠟燭！（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T09:20:10.844616+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":693,"images":17,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}